{
 "id": "lENmCABLc_E",
 "title": "【楽園の裏側】砂漠地帯に生まれた有毒の海【Salton Sea】【ゆっくり解説】",
 "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/lENmCABLc_E/maxresdefault.webp",
 "description": "カリフォルニアの砂漠に突如現れた「毒の海」ソルトン湖（Salton Sea)。かつては多くのセレブも訪れたリゾート地が、なぜ魚も住めない死の湖へと変貌したのか？\n120年前から始まった数奇な運命と、現在進行形の環境汚染、そして再生への挑戦をゆっくり解説します。楽園の裏側に隠された真実とは。\n\n※YouTubeのガイドラインに従い、一部にAI生成画像を使用しているため『合成コンテンツ』を表示しております。\n\n参考資料\nGeohydrologic Reconnaissance of the Imperial Valley, California\nhttps://pubs.usgs.gov/pp/0486k/report.pdf\n\nMissing Water The Uses and Flows of Water in the Colorado River Delta Region\nhttps://pacinst.org/wp-content/uploads/2001/09/missing_water_report_web-1.pdf\n\nColorado River Basin Water Management: Evaluating and Adjusting to Hydroclimatic Variability (2007)\nhttps://www.nationalacademies.org/read/11857/chapter/4\n\nhttps://pubs.usgs.gov/wsp/0395/plate-2.pdf\n\nThe Salton Sea: An Account of Hartman's Flight with the Colorado River\nhttps://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/89/The_Salton_Sea%3B_an_account_of_Harriman%27s_fight_with_the_Colorado_River_%28IA_cu31924022876068%29.pdf\n\nSalton Seismic Imaging\nhttps://www.usgs.gov/programs/earthquake-hazards/science/salton-seismic-imaging#overview\n\nInfluence of sediment input and plate-motion obliquity\non basin development along an active oblique-divergent\nplate boundary: Gulf of California and Salton Trough\nhttps://pages.uoregon.edu/rdorsey/Downloads/Dorsey%26Umhoefer2012.pdf\n\nChronology of Miocene−Pliocene deposits at Split Mountain Gorge, Southern\nCalifornia: A record of regional tectonics and Colorado River evolution\nhttps://wpg.forestry.oregonstate.edu/sites/default/files/seminars/07_Dorsey_Geology.pdf\n\nIsotopic and geochemical evidence of palaeoclimate changes in\nSalton Basin, California, during the past 20 kyr: 2. 87Sr/86Sr\nratio in lake tufa as an indicator of connection between\nColorado River and Salton Basin\nhttps://scispace.com/pdf/isotopic-and-geochemical-evidence-of-palaeoclimate-changes-1fzhypkgje.pdf\n\nFormation of California's Salton Sea in 1905-07 was not \"accidental\"\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/publication/340038533_Formation_of_California's_Salton_Sea_in_1905-07_was_not_accidental\n\nFish and fish-eating birds at the Salton Sea: a century of boom and bust\nhttps://labs.bio.unc.edu/hurlbert/pubs/Hurlbert%20et%20al%202007.pdf\n\nNutrient loading as a key cause of short- and long-term anthropogenic ecological degradation of the Salton Sea\nhttps://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11682391/\n\nHISTRY OF THE SOLTON SEA\nhttps://nrm.dfg.ca.gov/FileHandler.ashx?DocumentID=8654\n\nThe Salton Sea -- an area rich with lithium -- is a hot spot for child respiratory issues\nhttps://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2024/11/241101183403.htm\n\nThe story of the first decade in Imperial valley, California\nhttps://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/The_story_of_the_first_decade_in_Imperial_valley%2C_California_%28IA_storyoffirstdeca00howe%29.pdf\n\nCohort profile: The Assessing Imperial Valley Respiratory Health and the Environment (AIRE) study\nhttps://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38450855/\n\nDust from the drying Salton Sea pollutes nearby communities\nhttps://www.sdsu.edu/news/2024/06/dust-from-the-drying-salton\n\n\n\n【お知らせ】いつも応援ありがとうございます！\nメンバーシップで今後の活動をサポートしていただけると、大きな励みになります。\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWX0rU4o9CR8nUJKz0bSMlQ/join\n\n▼使用素材\n■映像素材・画像素材\npixabay\nhttps://pixabay.com/ja/videos/\npexels\nhttps://www.pexels.com/ja-jp/videos/\nACイラスト\nhttps://www.ac-illust.com/\nFreepik\nhttps://jp.freepik.com/\nSILHOUETTE DESIGN\nhttps://kage-design.com/\n\n■音源素材\nartlist\nhttps://artlist.io/\nhttps://pocketse.booth.pm/items/3767621\n効果音ラボ\nhttps://soundeffect-lab.info/\n\n【楽曲提供：株式会社ウナシ】\n\n#ゆっくり解説 #地理 #地政学",
